"href=\"%(url_contacto)s\">Escríbenos por aquí</a> en vez."
msgstr ""
"At G&amp;T Global Service we take the time to understand your operation so "
"we can give you an accurate proposal. Fill out the form below in as much "
"detail as possible and we'll get back to you shortly. Just have a general "
"question? <a href=\"%(url_contacto)s\">Reach us here</a> instead."

